(7244909, 1124373, 156466, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but am bothered by the (apparent) off-cantered biscuits in the plate, and what appears to be a short edge on the right of the same plate.  I suspect this has everything to do with a wide angle lens close to the subject.  Pulled back with a longer lens and that goes away.  The cup exhibits the same shifting, but doesn''t bother me thanks to the handle.  7 that could have been a 9.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but am bothered by the (apparent) off-cantered biscuits in the plate, and what appears to be a short edge on the right of the same plate.  I suspect this has everything to do with a wide angle lens close to the subject.  Pulled back with a longer lens and that goes away.  The cup exhibits the same shifting, but doesn''t bother me thanks to the handle.  7 that could have been a 9.', '2014-07-28 11:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
