(7245260, 1124362, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, "Godfather" lighting and expression.  An almost perfect portrait, but the way he''s holding the saucer really bugs me. Mixed messages: is he offering it, taking it back, protecting it....?</td>', 'Wonderful, "Godfather" lighting and expression.  An almost perfect portrait, but the way he''s holding the saucer really bugs me. Mixed messages: is he offering it, taking it back, protecting it....?', '2014-07-29 11:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
