(7245298, 1124331, 96751, '<td valign="top">Mixed metaphors is nice. But there are conflicting elements in here. The modern coffee cup and "foam art" with a mason jar filled with Splenda instead of sugar. What look looks like a soda can under the tripod, next to the polaroid. Doesn''t quite work for me</td>', 'Mixed metaphors is nice. But there are conflicting elements in here. The modern coffee cup and "foam art" with a mason jar filled with Splenda instead of sugar. What look looks like a soda can under the tripod, next to the polaroid. Doesn''t quite work for me', '2014-07-29 12:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
