(7245387, 1124405, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like your angle and your choice of shallow DOF to emphasize the beans. The table it''s a nice, almost rustic, touch to the image as well.</td>', 'I like your angle and your choice of shallow DOF to emphasize the beans. The table it''s a nice, almost rustic, touch to the image as well.', '2014-07-29 16:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245390, 1124369, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast here and the street scenery. If I had to nitpick, I''d get rid of the gentleman in the background.</td>', 'I like the contrast here and the street scenery. If I had to nitpick, I''d get rid of the gentleman in the background.', '2014-07-29 16:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245391, 1123644, 58634, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea but definitely needs to be in focus and have better lighting. <br/> <br/>Personally I would''ve also preferred an angle that helps emphasize the symmetry of the cups positioned like that.</td>', 'This is a great idea but definitely needs to be in focus and have better lighting.  Personally I would''ve also preferred an angle that helps emphasize the symmetry of the cups positioned like that.', '2014-07-29 16:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245392, 1124419, 58634, '<td valign="top">He seems frustrated. Perhaps he''s checking his DPC score? Ha!<br/> <br/>The image is a tad too dark, but I like the composition that includes the artwork on the wall.</td>', 'He seems frustrated. Perhaps he''s checking his DPC score? Ha! The image is a tad too dark, but I like the composition that includes the artwork on the wall.', '2014-07-29 16:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245395, 1124380, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the concept that you were going for here. Perhaps it would be improved by having(at least some of) the beans in focus that way some of the smoke would be in focus too. But I do like tht you included that as it definitely conveys the message of "hot!"</td>', 'I like the concept that you were going for here. Perhaps it would be improved by having(at least some of) the beans in focus that way some of the smoke would be in focus too. But I do like tht you included that as it definitely conveys the message of "hot!"', '2014-07-29 16:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245396, 1124102, 58634, '<td valign="top">Well if it makes me want to have some of it, then it''s a good shot.<br/> <br/>Looks delicious and beautiful.</td>', 'Well if it makes me want to have some of it, then it''s a good shot. Looks delicious and beautiful.', '2014-07-29 16:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245397, 1123689, 58634, '<td valign="top">That''s coffee? I am no coffee connoiseur but I''ve never seen coffee like that. <br/> <br/>Regardless, I like this macro shot although I find myself wishing the lighting wasn''t as orange, especially due to the reflections on the spoon being distracting. But I understand that being a hard task to accomplish.</td>', 'That''s coffee? I am no coffee connoiseur but I''ve never seen coffee like that.  Regardless, I like this macro shot although I find myself wishing the lighting wasn''t as orange, especially due to the reflections on the spoon being distracting. But I understand that being a hard task to accomplish.', '2014-07-29 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245398, 1124423, 58634, '<td valign="top">Creative! Almost slightly scary.. But I guess that''s how coffee would feel if coffee had feelings.</td>', 'Creative! Almost slightly scary.. But I guess that''s how coffee would feel if coffee had feelings.', '2014-07-29 16:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245400, 1124331, 58634, '<td valign="top">Creative items here. My nitpick is that the Splenda seems out of place in an image like this seeing as you have older style cameras. I could be wrong, but Splenda probably wasn''t in existence back then? Like I said, that''s just a nitpicky side comment. <br/> <br/>I do like this image.</td>', 'Creative items here. My nitpick is that the Splenda seems out of place in an image like this seeing as you have older style cameras. I could be wrong, but Splenda probably wasn''t in existence back then? Like I said, that''s just a nitpicky side comment.  I do like this image.', '2014-07-29 16:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245402, 1124350, 58634, '<td valign="top">That''s got to be one of the weirdest and quirkiest mugs I''ve seen. Pretty neat. <br/> <br/>I like this image but feel like it could use a contrast bump. I''m also not a fan of the gray border as it seems to me it dulls out the image even more.</td>', 'That''s got to be one of the weirdest and quirkiest mugs I''ve seen. Pretty neat.  I like this image but feel like it could use a contrast bump. I''m also not a fan of the gray border as it seems to me it dulls out the image even more.', '2014-07-29 16:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245403, 1124166, 58634, '<td valign="top">Good set up, I like the way the steps are sort of portrayed here. However, I can''t help but wish that the coffee maker wasn''t cropped off at the top.</td>', 'Good set up, I like the way the steps are sort of portrayed here. However, I can''t help but wish that the coffee maker wasn''t cropped off at the top.', '2014-07-29 16:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245404, 1124388, 58634, '<td valign="top">MMMMM indeed. This certainly looks delicious. I like the color and bokeh in the background too as it makes this warm and inviting. Looks like a gret stock image.</td>', 'MMMMM indeed. This certainly looks delicious. I like the color and bokeh in the background too as it makes this warm and inviting. Looks like a gret stock image.', '2014-07-29 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245405, 1124312, 58634, '<td valign="top">Silly and fun. I also like the background. Good contrast, too.</td>', 'Silly and fun. I also like the background. Good contrast, too.', '2014-07-29 17:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7245406, 1124425, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow focus, but find this has a bit of an awkward crop.  Especially since it slices her right at the head and her foot stands out in the corner wierdly. Maybe a horizontal crop to include the table/cup and her hands? Just my opinion.</td>', 'I like the shallow focus, but find this has a bit of an awkward crop.  Especially since it slices her right at the head and her foot stands out in the corner wierdly. Maybe a horizontal crop to include the table/cup and her hands? Just my opinion.', '2014-07-29 17:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
