(7245706, 1124268, 175946, '<td valign="top">thank you for the comments. <br/> <br/>Johanna, thank you especially for that great critique, much appreciated. I particularly appreciated the idea about reducing the light on one side and yes, you were right about it being two sources (speed lights). Just learning how to do that and had one set up as a slave, which would not fire most of the time. Got unbelievably frustrated and must have done a hundred takes. Need to buy those radio trigger things I guess. <br/> <br/>Any thanks again.</td>', 'thank you for the comments.  Johanna, thank you especially for that great critique, much appreciated. I particularly appreciated the idea about reducing the light on one side and yes, you were right about it being two sources (speed lights). Just learning how to do that and had one set up as a slave, which would not fire most of the time. Got unbelievably frustrated and must have done a hundred takes. Need to buy those radio trigger things I guess.  Any thanks again.', '2014-07-30 01:24:44.000000', NULL, 0),
