(7245973, 1124362, 121111, '<td valign="top">I was home alone ... testing a grid I made for the soft box<br/>setup all the paraphernalia with the softbox, grid, radio remote for the flash, the tripod for the flash, <br/>got dressed , upper part only , wearing shorts and bare footed<br/>setup the camera on the tripod<br/>put a dark drape over a window to lower ambient light<br/>set the camera to manual focus on the edge of the sofa<br/>set the timer on the camera to 10 secs<br/>set it to monochrome with green filter filter<br/>take a few test shots to set the exposure<br/>composition varied a bit from frame to frame <br/>my wife came home <br/>after a few laughs <br/>she helped press the shutter a few times <br/>tried unsuccessfully to get boiling water in the cup to get some steam <br/> <br/>anyway .... <br/> <br/>The image did pretty good <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the votes and comments<br/> <br/></td>', 'I was home alone ... testing a grid I made for the soft boxsetup all the paraphernalia with the softbox, grid, radio remote for the flash, the tripod for the flash, got dressed , upper part only , wearing shorts and bare footedsetup the camera on the tripodput a dark drape over a window to lower ambient lightset the camera to manual focus on the edge of the sofaset the timer on the camera to 10 secsset it to monochrome with green filter filtertake a few test shots to set the exposurecomposition varied a bit from frame to frame my wife came home after a few laughs she helped press the shutter a few times tried unsuccessfully to get boiling water in the cup to get some steam  anyway ....  The image did pretty good  Thanks for all the votes and comments ', '2014-07-31 01:03:11.000000', NULL, 0),
