(7255261, 1124102, 119012, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Color Saturation and Hue: Colors are realistic<br/> <br/>Brightness and contrast: image is mostly well lit, the lights on the croissant are a bit hot.<br/> <br/>Focus and depth of field: clean and sharp<br/> <br/>nice clean sharp image, the crop could be adjusted to center the plate perfectly inside the border.its a nice setup up against a nice backdrop.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: Color Saturation and Hue: Colors are realistic Brightness and contrast: image is mostly well lit, the lights on the croissant are a bit hot. Focus and depth of field: clean and sharp nice clean sharp image, the crop could be adjusted to center the plate perfectly inside the border.its a nice setup up against a nice backdrop.', '2014-08-26 09:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255262, 1124361, 119012, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Color Saturation and Hue: Colors are realistic<br/> <br/>Brightness and contrast: image is mostly well lit, love the spot lighting on the subjects<br/> <br/>Focus and depth of field: clean and sharp<br/> <br/>nice clean sharp image, not much to critique negatively, its well done.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: Color Saturation and Hue: Colors are realistic Brightness and contrast: image is mostly well lit, love the spot lighting on the subjects Focus and depth of field: clean and sharp nice clean sharp image, not much to critique negatively, its well done.', '2014-08-26 09:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255265, 1123644, 119012, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Color Saturation and Hue: Colors are unrealistic and muddy<br/> <br/>Brightness and contrast: image is a bit dark and uneven.<br/> <br/>Focus and depth of field: you got some camera shake and at 1/15 shutter im not surprised.<br/> <br/>nice concept that wasn''t executed properly. you probably could have nailed a ribbon with this entry if it was sharp centered better during cropping and taken from a lower angle to accentuate the heart shape</td>', 'Critique Club Review: Color Saturation and Hue: Colors are unrealistic and muddy Brightness and contrast: image is a bit dark and uneven. Focus and depth of field: you got some camera shake and at 1/15 shutter im not surprised. nice concept that wasn''t executed properly. you probably could have nailed a ribbon with this entry if it was sharp centered better during cropping and taken from a lower angle to accentuate the heart shape', '2014-08-26 09:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7255266, 1124312, 119012, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Color Saturation and Hue: not sure color wouldn''t have been a better choice<br/> <br/>Brightness and contrast: image is mostly well lit, the eye are a bit bright compare to the rest of the image<br/> <br/>Focus and depth of field: clean and sharp<br/> <br/>nice clean sharp image, not much to critique negatively, its well done.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: Color Saturation and Hue: not sure color wouldn''t have been a better choice Brightness and contrast: image is mostly well lit, the eye are a bit bright compare to the rest of the image Focus and depth of field: clean and sharp nice clean sharp image, not much to critique negatively, its well done.', '2014-08-26 09:17:29.000000', NULL, 0);
